@testray.main.component.name = "Support QA"
@type = "customer.portal"

Feature: Downloads
	Testing the Downloads portlet

Setup:
	* I get all test passwords and admin emails
	* I log into the support homepage as "${staticSupportAdminEmailAdress}" with password "${staticSupportAdminPassword}"
	* I go to the Downloads page

Scenario: View Downloads Multiple Page Results
	@ help.center.acceptance = "true"
	@ help.center.smoke = "true"
	Viewing multiple pages of downloads should work properly

	Given I set the search filters to the "DXP 7.0" product and "Fix Packs" file type
	Then the download with the name "Liferay DXP 7.0 Fix Pack 86" should be visible with the following values
	| Date         | Sep 25, 2019                                                                                                  |
	| Name         | Liferay DXP 7.0 Fix Pack 86                                                                                   |
	| Link         | Changelog                                                                                                     |
	| Link         | Important Changes                                                                                             |
	| Link         | Installation Instructions                                                                                     |
	| Info Message | This fix pack provides a solution for SEV-3 security issues in LPE-16850, LPE-16807, LPE-16710 and LPE-16698. |
	| Size         | File Size: 341 MB                                                                                             |
	| MD5          | MD5: E7F998D19B7CCC7AA1BE1451889DFB04                                                                         |
